(49591: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%21%2Fusr%2Fbin%2Fenv%20node%0A%2F%2F%20Measures%2C%20per%20module%2C%20how%20far%20the%20self-translation%20of%20each%20JavaScript%20module%0A%2F%2F%20of%20js%2Fsrc%20into%20Rust%20is%20from%20its%20hand-written%20Rust%20counterpart%0A%2F%2F%20%28rust%2Fsrc%2F%3Cpath%20in%20snake%20case%3E.rs%20or%20...%2Fmod.rs%29%2C%20and%20writes%20the%20report%20as%0A%2F%2F%20Markdown%20and%20inspectable%20Links%20Notation.%20CI%20runs%20it%20on%20every%20push%20and%0A%2F%2F%20publishes%20both%3B%20it%20reads%20the%20whole%20source%20tree%2C%20so%20it%20is%20not%20meant%20for%20a%0A%2F%2F%20local%20run%20%28pass%20--modules%20to%20measure%20a%20few%20modules%29.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20node%20js%2Fscripts%2Fgenerate-self-translation-report.mjs%20--out-dir%20%3Cdir%3E%20%5B--modules%20a.js%2Cb.js%5D%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%5B--decorators%20parity%2Fself-translation%2Fdecorators.lino%5D%20%5B--shard%20K%2FN%5D%20%5B--list%5D%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%5B--replay-plan%20selected-blockers.lino%5D%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20The%20whole%20tree%20takes%20over%20an%20hour%20on%20one%20runner%2C%20so%20CI%20splits%20it%3A%20%60--shard%0A%2F%2F%20K%2FN%60%20measures%20the%20K-th%20of%20N%20shards%2C%20balanced%20with%20source-bound%20CI%20timings%0A%2F%2F%20and%20byte-size%20estimates%20for%20changed%20sources.%20%60--list%60%20lists%20its%20modules.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20For%20each%20module%20the%20report%20lists%20its%20top-level%20items%20by%20status%2C%20the%20Rust%0A%2F%2F%20functions%20the%20translation%20writes%2C%20how%20many%20of%20them%20the%20hand-written%20Rust%0A%2F%2F%20defines%20under%20the%20same%20name%20and%20how%20many%20of%20those%20are%20identical%20up%20to%0A%2F%2F%20whitespace%2C%20and%20the%20code%20lines%20of%20the%20translation%20%28no%20comments%2C%20preludes%20or%0A%2F%2F%20blank%20lines%29%20the%20hand-written%20Rust%20holds%20too%2C%20counted%20as%20a%20multiset.%20Each%0A%2F%2F%20module%20is%20measured%20twice%2C%20by%20the%20generic%20translation%20and%20by%20the%20translation%0A%2F%2F%20with%20the%20shared%20emitter%20decorators%20%28docs%2Fdecorators.md%29%2C%20so%20the%20report%20shows%0A%2F%2F%20how%20much%20of%20the%20difference%20the%20decorators%20close.%0Aimport%20%7B%20existsSync%2C%20mkdirSync%2C%20readdirSync%2C%20readFileSync%2C%20realpathSync%2C%20writeFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Afs%27%3B%0Aimport%20assert%20from%20%27node%3Aassert%2Fstrict%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20execFileSync%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Achild_process%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20dirname%2C%20join%2C%20posix%2C%20relative%2C%20resolve%2C%20sep%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Apath%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20createHash%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Acrypto%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20fileURLToPath%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aurl%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20isMainThread%20%7D%20from%20%27node%3Aworker_threads%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20readProjectData%2C%20writeProjectData%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fproject-data.mjs%27%3B%0A%0Aimport%20%7B%20DecoratorSet%20%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Fdecorators.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20parseProgrammingLanguage%20%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Fprogramming-language-parser.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20selfTranslate%2C%20selfTranslationSignatures%20%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20tokenize%20%7D%20from%20%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Flexer.js%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20createReportMeasurementWorker%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fself-translation-report-worker-host.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20rankSelfTranslationBlockers%2C%20requireReportSourcePath%2C%20validateSelfTranslationReplayPlan%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fself-translation-report-blockers.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20summarizeRetainedSelfTranslationPhases%2C%20retainedSelfTranslationPhaseMarkdown%20%7D%20from%20%27.%2Fself-translation-phase-summary.mjs%27%3B%0Aimport%20%7BpartitionMeasuredWorkloads%7D%20from%20%27.%2Ftest-groups.mjs%27%3B%0A%0Aconst%20root%20%3D%20resolve%28dirname%28fileURLToPath%28import.meta.url%29%29%2C%20%27..%2