(145961: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20Translates%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20between%20JavaScript%2C%20TypeScript%20and%0A%2F%2F%21%20Rust%20through%20meta-language%20links.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20The%20source%20is%20parsed%20losslessly%20with%20its%20default%20grammar%3B%20a%20translation%0A%2F%2F%21%20into%20the%20same%20language%20writes%20the%20links%20back%20byte%20for%20byte%2C%20and%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20translation%20into%20the%20other%20language%20translates%20each%20top-level%20item%20the%0A%2F%2F%21%20portable%20core%20can%20express%20and%20carries%20every%20other%20item%20verbatim%20in%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20marked%20comment.%20Both%20kinds%20of%20item%20keep%20their%20source%20as%20provenance%2C%20so%0A%2F%2F%21%20translating%20an%20unedited%20translation%20back%20restores%20the%20source%20byte%20for%0A%2F%2F%21%20byte.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Fself-translation.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Afrontend_rules%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20accept_source_envelope_restoration%2C%20accept_source_prefix_restoration%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3ASExpr%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3ABTreeMap%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3A%3AWrite%20as%20_%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Async%3A%3ALazyLock%3B%0A%0Ause%20regex%3A%3ARegex%3B%0Ause%20sha2%3A%3A%7BDigest%2C%20Sha256%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Adecorators%3A%3ADecoratorSet%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Agrammar%3A%3Adecorate_emitted%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3Atranslation%3A%3Asurface%3A%3AExternal%3B%0Ause%20crate%3A%3A%7BLinkNetwork%2C%20ParseConfiguration%7D%3B%0A%0Amod%20binding%3B%0Amod%20emission%3B%0Apub%20mod%20representation%3B%0Amod%20representation_rules%3B%0Ause%20emission%3A%3Aemit_item%3B%0Ause%20representation%3A%3AContext%3B%0Amod%20scope%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure%3B%0Amod%20typescript_erasure_rules%3B%0Amod%20typescript_portable_typing%3B%0Ause%20scope%3A%3A%7BBindingScopeContext%2C%20translate_binding_groups%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20self%3A%3Abinding%3A%3A%7BBinder%2C%20ModuleSignatureContext%7D%3B%0Ause%20typescript_erasure%3A%3Arequires_type_script_erasure%3B%0Apub%20use%20typescript_erasure%3A%3A%7BErasedTypeScript%2C%20Erasure%2C%20erase_type_script%7D%3B%0Apub%20use%20typescript_portable_typing%3A%3Aproject_type_script_typing%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20The%20signature%20of%20an%20exported%20item%20of%20a%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20module.%0A%2F%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%2F%20It%20binds%20the%20name%20a%20module%20that%20imports%20it%20uses%3A%20a%20function%27s%20parameters%0A%2F%2F%2F%20and%20result%2C%20or%20a%20constant%27s%20type%20and%20whether%20a%20literal%20gives%20its%20value.%0Apub%20type%20SelfTranslationSignature%20%3D%20External%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20What%20%5B%60self_translate_with%60%5D%20translates%20a%20module%20with.%0A%23%5Bderive%28Clone%2C%20Debug%2C%20Default%2C%20PartialEq%2C%20Eq%29%5D%0Apub%20struct%20SelfTranslationOptions%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20emitter%20decorators%2C%20as%20%5B%60self_translate_decorated%60%5D%20applies%20them.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20decorators%3A%20DecoratorSet%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20module%27s%20directory%20inside%20its%20crate%2C%20as%20path%20segments%3A%20the%20crate%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20root%20when%20empty.%20A%20relative%20import%20becomes%20a%20%60use%20crate%3A%3A%E2%80%A6%60%20of%20the%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20module%20it%20names%20from%20there.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20module_directory%3A%20Vec%3CString%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20The%20signatures%20%5B%60self_translation_signatures%60%5D%20gives%20for%20each%20module%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20the%20module%20imports%2C%20by%20import%20specifier%2C%20which%20bind%20the%20imported%20names.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20imports%3A%20BTreeMap%3CString%2C%20Vec%3CSelfTranslationSignature%3E%3E%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%2F%20Select%20the%20shared%20UTF16%20prelude%20and%20paired%20Text%20lowering%3B%20unsupported%20emissions%20are%20carried.%0A%20%20%20%20pub%20utf16_strings%3A%20bool%2C%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%2F%20The%20languages%20self-translation%20reads%20and%20writes.%0Apub%20const%20SELF_TRANSLATION_LANGUAGES%3A%20%5B%26str%3B%203%5D%20%3D%20%5B%22JavaScript%22%2C%20%22TypeScript%22%2C%20%22Rust%22%5D%3B%0A%0Aconst%20HEADER%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aself-translation%3Av1%20%22%3B%0Aconst%20CARRIED%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Acarried%20%22%3B%0Aconst%20TRANSLATED%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Atranslated%20%22%3B%0Aconst%20SOURCE_LINE%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20%7C%22%3B%0Aconst%20PRELUDE_BEGIN%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aprelude%20begin%22%3B%0Aconst%20PRELUDE_END%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%2F%2F%20meta-language%3Aprelude%20end%22%3B%0A%2F%2F%20Portable-core%20Rust%20keeps%20the%20source%27s%20parentheses%20and%20names.%0Aconst%20RUST_ALLOW%3A%20%26str%20%3D%20%22%23%21%5Ballow%28unused%2C%20unreachable_patterns%2C%20non_snake_case%2C%20non_camel_case_types%2C%20invalid_nan_comparisons%29%5D%22%3B%0Aconst%20COMMENTS%3A%20%5B%26str%3B%203%5D%20%3D%20%5B%22comment%22%2C%20%22line_comment%22%2C%20%22block_comment%22%5D%3B%0A%0Astatic%20RUST_EXPORT%3A%20LazyLock%3CRegex%3E%20%3D%0A%20%20%20%20LazyLock%3A%3Anew%28%7C%7C%20Regex%3A%3Anew%28r%22%28%3Fm%29%5Epub%28%5C%28%5B%5E%29%5D%2A%5C%29%29%3F%5Cs%22%29.expect%28%22a%20valid%20pattern%22%29%29%3B%0Astatic%20JAVASCRIPT_EXPORT%3A%20LazyLock%3CRegex%3E%20%3D%0A%20%20%20%20LazyLock%3A%3Anew%28%7C%7C%20Regex%3A%3Anew%28r%22%28%3Fm%29%5Eexport%5Cs%22%29.expect%28%22a%20valid%20pattern%22%29%29%3B%0Astatic%20RUST_MAIN%3A%20LazyLock%3CRegex%3E%20%3D%0A%20%20%20%20LazyLock%3A%3Anew%28%7C%7C%20Regex%3A%3Anew%28r%22%5Cbfn%5Cs%2Bmain%5Cs%2A%5C%28%22%29.expect%28%22a%20valid%20pattern%22%29%29%3B%0Astatic%20LINE_BREAK%3A%20LazyLock%3CRegex%3E%20%3D%0A%20%20%20%20LazyLock%3A%3Anew%28%7C%7C%20Regex%3A%3Anew%28r%22%5Cr%3F%5Cn%22%29.expect%28